  id: hardened
  displayName: Hardened
  description: 'A brute, physical edge on every hit. Elemental family: Physical,
    the damage half -- Ironclad is Physical''s resistance affix and Juggernaut is
    Physical''s stagger-proc affix, both split off this modifier''s old three-effect
    bundle (the one family with a third effect, since Physical had no typed-resistance
    twin worth calling out the way the other five elements do -- see Ironclad and
    Juggernaut''s own descriptions).'
